                <pb facs="0566" n="380" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg380"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Editor’s Note</hi></head>
                <p>—No official record of this conversation has been found. The principal subject of
                    discussion was the distribution of captured German vessels. In the course of the
                    conversation Morse communicated to Weston a draft memorandum from Land to
                        Clayton on this subject.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d710a-99-f1"/></p>
            </div>
        </body>
